{
  "job_B17.4_20251003_114404": {
    "text": "Swa \u00fe\u00e6t hig unea\u00f0e specon mihton, \u00fear\u00e6fter gefor se abbod Petrus on Glowecestre on \u00feone d\u00e6g\nOn \u00f0ysum geare w\u00e6s se king Henrig on Windeles oran to \u00f0am midanwintran, & b\u00e6r \u00f0ar his\nEac he geaf \u00fe\u00e6t abbotrice on Ramesige Rainalde w\u00e6s munuc on Ca\u00f0um.\nEac he geaf \u00fe\u00e6t abbotrice on Eoforwic Ricarde w\u00e6s munuc on \u00f0am ylcon mynstre.\nEac he geaf \u00fe\u00e6t abbotrice \u00e6t \u00f0ornige Rodberte w\u00e6s munuc \u00e6t Sancte Ebroulfi.\nEac he geaf \u00feone eorldom on Nor\u00f0hamtunscire Dauide w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6re cwene bro\u00f0or.\n\u00dear\u00e6fter gefor Thomas se arcebiscop on Eoforwic on \u00f0one d\u00e6g xiii kalendas Mar \u00fear\u00e6fter he geaf\n\u00dea to \u00f0am Eastran he w\u00e6s \u00e6t \u00deorp wi\u00f0 Nor\u00f0hamtune.\n\u00dear\u00e6fter he geaf \u00fe\u00e6t ercebiscoprice on Cantwarabyrig Rawulf w\u00e6s biscop on Rofeceastre; And\n\u00dea \u00f0ar\u00e6fter gefor se abbot Nigel on Byrtune on \u00f0one d\u00e6g v No Mai.\n\u00dear\u00e6fter forbarn Cicestre & \u00fe\u00e6t mynster \u00f0ar for\u00f0 mid on \u00f0one d\u00e6g iii No Mai.\n\u00dea to \u00f0am Pentecosten w\u00e6s se king \u00e6t sancte Albanes stowe.\nHer\u00e6fter he ferde mid his fyrde into Wealan to mide sumeran & macode castelas \u00f0arinne.\nAnd \u00f0a Wyliscean kingas coman to him & becoman his menn & him held a\u00f0as sworan.\n\u00dear\u00e6fter he com to Wincestre & geaf \u00f0ar \u00fe\u00e6t ercebiscoprice on Eoforwic Turstane his clerice.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t abbodrice \u00e6t sancte Eadmunde he geaf Albolde w\u00e6s munuc on Becc.\nOn \u00f0one d\u00e6g xviii kalendas Sept.\n\u00dear\u00e6fter he geaf \u00fe\u00e6t abbotrice on Myclan yge Ealdulfe w\u00e6s munuc on \u00f0am ylcon mynstre.\nOn \u00f0one d\u00e6g Exaltatio Sanct\u00e6.\nEac he geaf \u00fe\u00e6t abbotrice on Byrtune Goisfri \u00f0e w\u00e6s munuc on Ealdan mynstre.\n\u00c6t \u00f0am ylcon s\u00e6le se arcebiscop Radulf geaf \u00fe\u00e6t biscoprice on Rofecestre.",
